    "CUR-BULK"
  ],
  "description": "LB holds a short Memo (row 1), a 12,000-character Memo (row 2) and an all-Null row 3. Edit row 3 of a dynaset, AppendChunk a 64-byte binary into Bn, Update. Then, on a table-type, a dynaset, a snapshot and a forward-only recordset over LB: GetRows(3) and read BOF, EOF and ID; and on a dynaset over \"SELECT Bn FROM LB ORDER BY ID\" GetRows(3). The VARIANT of each call is captured exactly. Asks the VARIANT type and length of a large Memo and of a binary cell, the Null cells and the array dimensions per type. The fixture copy is opened read-write.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
  "invokeLcid": 1033,
